<%# D3: the app states how long it keeps a document rather than leaving it
    implied. Unlike its predecessor this app writes files to disk, so the
    promise is worth stating precisely.

    The period comes from Document::RETENTION so the promise and the behaviour
    cannot drift apart. %>
<p class="text-body text-ink-muted">
  <% if document %>
    We remove this document, and everything we worked out from it, at
    <strong><%= document.expires_at.strftime("%-l:%M %p") %></strong> —
    <%= Document::RETENTION.inspect %> after you added it.
  <% else %>
    We remove your document, and everything we work out from it,
    <%= Document::RETENTION.inspect %> after you add it.
  <% end %>
</p>
